  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“This one goes out to my biggest fan!”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite(s):</strong> Soundweaver 16th or evoker minstrel 12th, kinetic healer<sup>OA</sup> utility wild talent</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> By accepting one point of burn as a free action when activating soothing performance, you can choose one creature to be healed as if affected by kinetic healer<sup>OA</sup> rather than mass cure serious wounds, as well as adding the effect of a metahealer<sup>OA</sup> ability for which you would qualify as a kinetic chirurgeon of your soundweaver or evoker minstrel level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
